Test: Edge cases for delete (GAWK compatible)
--------------------------------------
Test 1: Delete from empty array
  After delete empty[1]: length = 0
  After delete empty[2] (non-existent): length = 0

Test 2: Delete array element with string key
  Before: length = 3
  After delete assoc[key2]: length = 2
  assoc[key1] = value1
  assoc[key2] = 
  assoc[key3] = value3

Test 3: Multiple deletes in sequence
  Before: length = 5
  After deleting [2], [4], [1]: length = 2
  multi[3] = c
  multi[5] = e

Test 4: Delete non-existent element multiple times
  Before: length = 1
  After deleting [99] three times: length = 1
  test[1] = 10

Test 5: Delete and re-add
  Before delete: length = 2
  After delete [1]: length = 1
  After re-adding [1]: length = 2
  dynamic[1] = new_first
  dynamic[2] = second

